:: bat {"position":"700,825"}
<<scenery bat>>
You are currently standing in your bathroom.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<wanderingSlaves>>\
    <<set _slaves = Bathroom.getDemandingSlaves()>>\
    <<set _demandIndex to 0>>\
    <<include slaveDemand>>
    <<keyOption [[Leave your bathroom|main]] 🚪>>
    <<keyAction 'Take a shower' 🛀>><<addHours 1>><</keyAction>>: 1 hour
    <<if !$player.job or $player.workedToday or Now.isWeekend() or Now.isBetween('12:00 AM', '06:59 AM')>>\
        <<keyAction 'Go to sleep' 😴>><<sleep>><</keyAction>>
    <</if>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\